WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Hello everybody, my name is Markiplier

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:03.100
and welcome to Project Murphy

00:00:03.100 --> 00:00:05.800
Now much like you I spend my Saturdays home alone,

00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:08.280
making some SICK memes in Photoshop

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:09.240
but I thought to myself:

00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:11.820
"Can I have some robot do all this work for me

00:00:11.820 --> 00:00:15.400
because I'm pathetic and ready for the singularity to take over society

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:17.660
and all of us to be uploaded into the great computer?"

00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:20.300
Well look no further; that time is nigh

00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:23.260
because Project Murphy is here with Murphybot to make ALL your

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:23.860
meme-making and

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:25.780
masturbating troubles go away!

00:00:26.440 --> 00:00:27.740
What? I said "meme-making"...

00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:29.420
Nothin' else

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:30.140
You're weird...

00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:30.940
...

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:31.600
...I like that

00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:34.340
So the basic principle is you ask Murphybot a question

00:00:34.340 --> 00:00:35.920
in a very SPECIFIC way.

00:00:35.920 --> 00:00:37.920
It's like if Alex Trebek was a robot.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.380
...and probably dead. Which he's not.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:41.600
*deep and suspiciously* AS FAR AS WE KNOW.

00:00:41.600 --> 00:00:43.060
So it goes a lil' something like this:

00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:44.300
If I was to type a message

00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:48.140
"what if alex trebek was a robot"

00:00:48.140 --> 00:00:49.660
What is-OH, I misspelled it

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:50.760
I'm an idiot, look at that.

00:00:50.760 --> 00:00:52.620
Look how dumb I am. I'm very dumb

00:00:52.620 --> 00:00:54.620
Do the-what if...What if that thing I typed?

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:56.160
Whadda we got?

00:00:56.160 --> 00:00:56.660
Ooh!

00:00:56.820 --> 00:00:57.580
Euggghh

00:00:57.580 --> 00:01:00.380
Now rumor has it that when Watson won Jeopardy

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.820
It drove him steadily MAD

00:01:02.820 --> 00:01:04.600
And in an effort to beat Watson

00:01:04.600 --> 00:01:07.720
*deep growly voice* Alex Trebek decided to become a robot

00:01:07.720 --> 00:01:10.460
What IF--what if *butchered English* has legs?

00:01:10.460 --> 00:01:11.420
heads has leg-

00:01:11.420 --> 00:01:14.540
*sounds of disgust*

00:01:14.540 --> 00:01:16.820
Eugghh, it's a lil' too mannequinny for me

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:19.540
I-uh-dunno. It's too WELL DONE is the problem

00:01:19.540 --> 00:01:21.280
It's WAAAY well done

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:23.280
I-it's, it's waayy too well done.

00:01:23.280 --> 00:01:25.800
Oh, what IF sims were real?

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.800
Now that I spelled it right, is this gonna be correct?

00:01:28.280 --> 00:01:30.260
That's again, *grunt*

00:01:30.300 --> 00:01:33.140
I actually played this with Holly and Ross on Holly's channel.

00:01:33.140 --> 00:01:35.140
They introduced me to the game and uh...

00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:36.080
